{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1479.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"296e5abea9a9c876182571250dd17cd41fc9d7204586bdd0eda38f887fb8487d","ja":"ひなたのチャレンジ","zh":"日向的挑战","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1479.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"17ba216710b7f2f6d16318056c595948d53060dd035ed19e3ed7e1ac49bf4e72","ja":"うぅ……今日はごめんねぇ。あたしが、おかしなこと\nしたせいで、みんなも、やりづらかったっしょや？","zh":"呜呜……今天对不起啊。都是因为我犯傻，\n大家也都觉得很难办吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1479.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"893c9dace238b0962ea5b620ed52975cf851259ab54e8246eadb86fd585c7f65","ja":"たしかに、すっごくビックリしたかも～。","zh":"确实吓了很大一跳呢～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1479.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"01ef14abf1d314e51e46e7a2adc722564e89a9736bf1a3ffa63fe56f9499a785","ja":"木下さん、いったいどうしてあのようなことを？","zh":"木下，你到底为什么要做那种事？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1479.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"6845209eb8fb11c81f28e6dfb4e4d797aff3a8924cdb55af399a6be0cdbedf1f","ja":"えっとね、この前、なるを演じた美也さんが、\nSNSで面白いことをしてたっしょや？","zh":"那个呀，之前饰演了小鸣的美也，\n在社交平台上做了件挺有意思的事对吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1479.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"426f4eeba80bbf59ee1fd36d84eca2c070697372a3df67c94b1192396504860c","ja":"うん。確か、なるになりきって、\nSNSに投稿してたっけ。","zh":"嗯。我记得好像是完全化身为成，\n在SNS上发动态了吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1479.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"5c9e58a125e5e86a0f01c9a260ae3015f6da9a629c2301a3bec70568ce68aa6c","ja":"うん。だからあたしも、なにかできないか、\nSNSをいろいろ見てみたんだぁ。","zh":"嗯。所以我也是，想看看能不能帮上什么忙，\n就去刷了刷各种社交软件呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1479.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"cb4d284942a99e1e37439fe902c178018c8127a383d81ee9f10d28906e62900c","ja":"したっけ、みんないろんなこと書いてくれててねぇ。\nたとえばほら、こういうのとか。","zh":"然后呢，大家写了好多各种各样的事呢。\n比如说你看，像这种的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1479.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"37d8e505c9e73690a5ebd3af350275e57332976e884267f2045becd631690629","ja":"えっと……「なるみたいな、ちょっと気が弱くて\nおどおどしたひなたちゃんを、もっと見たい」……？","zh":"那个……“想看到更多像成那样，有点胆小\n又战战兢兢的小日向”……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1479.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"f8284184274463eb1eb735f9b3aaf2dac2b10ddcfbdb4a8c548289c6fa59df80","ja":"こっちは「もっとハイテンションなひなたちゃんが\n見たい。カメラアピールもガンガンやって」だって。","zh":"这边写着“想看到更情绪高涨的小日向。\n对镜头的表现也请积极大胆地展现出来”。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1479.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"9703531bb111be56c20903d2583c9125c73f1a87fc43bc31f917212f60463c8d","ja":"……もしかして、先ほどの番組で\n木下さんがされていた振る舞いは……。","zh":"……难道说，刚才在节目里\n木下小姐的表现是……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1479.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"8f5a97557e44a4d7c9b75d71da6cf0ec362a93ca75c8982485ab80f4e9152aa1","ja":"うん。あたし、これを参考に話してみたんだぁ。\n……あんまし、上手にはできなかったけども。","zh":"嗯。我试着参考这个去聊了聊。\n……虽然聊得不太好就是了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1479.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"96ad1697626e0d0d0be5120326fa0e43f350c6ef355d1066c6b2e9d3fa35976a","ja":"なるほど～。テンションが高かったり\nいつもと違う感じだったのは、そういうことか。","zh":"原来如此～。情绪那么高涨、\n和平时感觉不一样，原来是这么回事啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1479.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"e234871cf40596c70c664bc3cb8dc3f3dd186086be6c47e55c28b9843a579f30","ja":"「こんなあたしも見てみたい」っていう期待に\n応えねば！って、張り切ったんだけど……。","zh":"为了回应大家“也想看到这样的我”\n这份期待，虽然我也干劲满满……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1479.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"a5fabbf9115f6aba77301d0ac46dd01c3b39eaac92c0e71e206f3c08ff5d2f64","ja":"やってるうちに、なんだかよくわかんなく\nなってしまって……難しいねぇ……。","zh":"做着做着，不知不觉就完全搞不明白了\n……好难啊……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
